Figure 1: 78 cells checked against case A
Range check: 24576 JUMP words, ILLJ exactly when check_isa.py's legal(word, pc) is false

Random runs (seed 30): 4000 programs, 164554 cycles, 95309 slots, 4285 reset cycles
  every slot == loop_trace.py's Unit (issued word, PC, loop state, NOP counter, err_illegal)
  every cycle's busy == busy_trace.py's run() (the 2000 programs with legal JUMPs)
  slots that resolved a JUMP and read CRF twice: 11623; held over ([TOP-ISA-27]): 2131, which would need a third read without the hold
  illegal words: 11874, out-of-range JUMPs: 2779

ANEMOS (anemos_ctrl.out, case A): EXIT on command 7, 3 of them JUMP fetches; pcu_ctrl: EXIT in slot 4, no slot for a JUMP

ok   all cases match the doc
